                ] ],
                [ 'p', 'So you need a dark space, an exposure unit and a fair amount of trial and error, because poor exposure ruins fine detail. That is why classic screen printing mainly pays off for long runs of a single design.' ],
                [ 'h2', 'How does a laser make a screen printing stencil?' ],
