                [ 'p', 'You prepare the design in xTool’s software, which according to the manufacturer offers AI-assisted design, one-click colour separation, automatic CMYK separation and halftone filters. The frame and screen are separable, so a finished stencil is easy to swap, store and take with you.' ],
                [ 'p', 'Despite the name, the Screen Printer is not a separate printing machine but an accessory for your laser: the laser makes the stencil, and you push the ink through by hand. The Basic Kit comes in a version for the P/F/S/D series and one for the M series – pick the one that matches your laser when ordering.' ],
                [ 'products', '8295631454421' ],
                [ 'h2', 'Screen printing with a laser: what can you print?' ],
